              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuherezi abizunguze, bibe ishikanwa rizungurijwe imbere yanje, jewe Uhoraho; ivyo n’ivyera bizotwara umuherezi, hamwe na ya nkoro ishikanishwa kuzunguzwa, na ca gikenye c’ukuguru kigerewe abaherezi nyene. Ivyo birangiye, uwo Munaziri abone kunywa vino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.20",
